hat stays with you long after you&#8217;ve left the mat.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-13a6d44 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"13a6d44\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Hatha Yoga is Perfect for South Delhi's Busy Professionals<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bdcc2b3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bdcc2b3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you spend eight or more hours at a desk, Hatha Yoga may be the single most valuable thing you can do for your body. Shikha&#8217;s Hatha classes in South Delhi specifically address the posture problems, neck tension, lower back pain, and shallow breathing that desk work creates \u2014 using targeted sequences backed by her deep knowledge of anatomy<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6860f58 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6860f58\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What to Expect in a Hatha Yoga Class<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0bb34c1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0bb34c1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>Foundational asanas (postures) held with awareness and proper alignment<\/li><li>Pranayama (breath work) woven throughout \u2014 not added as an afterthought<\/li><li>Modifications for every pose \u2014 so no body is left behind<\/li><li>Closing relaxation (Savasana) to consolidate the practice<\/li><li>Available as private home sessions across South Delhi, or as group classes<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c533c83 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c533c83\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Hatha Yoga for Beginners in South Delhi<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a25836f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a25836f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Never done yoga before? Hatha is the ideal starting point. You don&#8217;t need flexibility, a particular body type, or any experience. You just need to be willing to start. Shikha has guided hundreds of complete beginners in Hauz Khas, Greater Kailash, Defence Colony, and across South Delhi into a confident, sustainable yoga practice.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b66eac elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"1b66eac\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9fbf2ed e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9fbf2ed\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-73f0014 e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-